              </div>
            </div>

            <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef2f7;margin:12px 0" />

            <h3>Data protection</h3>
            <p class="muted">Return-related personal data is processed in accordance with our <a href="/customer/legal-and-compliance/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. For subject access or deletion requests contact <a href="mailto:dpo@jood.com">dpo@jood.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
